---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>Welcome To Townscribe News</h1>
			<p>
				Where stories breathe, ideas flourish, and voices truly matter. At TownScribe, we believe every headline has a heartbeat, 
				Every opinion deserves a platform, and every reader deserves content that informs, inspires, and connects. 
				This is more than just a blogging and news website, It is a vibrant community built for thinkers, 
				Dreamers, creators, and everyday people who want to stay informed and inspired.
			</p>
			<p>
				From breaking news to lifestyle, politics, entertainment, culture, technology, and powerful humans stories, 
				we are committed to delivering fresh, authentic, and engaging content that speaks directly to you.
				Whether you are here to read, learn, share, or simply explore, we are honored to have you as part of this growing journey.
			</p>
			<p>Here are a few ideas on what to expect on this page:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Instant News</li>
				<li>Footballs News</li>
				<li>Your Favourite Blog</li>
				<li>Check out the included blog posts</li>
				<li>Customize the blog post page layout</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				Looking for a way to carryout your publicity or your blog? Check out
				<a href="https://github.com/baalebos-cloud">Baalebos</a>
				by <a href="https://x.com/townscribenews?s=21">Townscribe</a>.
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
